# type(scope): short summary (maximum 100 characters)
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, test, refactor, perf, build, ci, chore, style, revert
# Scope is optional. Chinese or English summaries are both supported.
# Example: fix(packaging): include standalone RAW decoder and source archive
#
# Explain the problem, resulting behavior, and relevant validation when useful.
# Keep local fixture paths, credentials, generated binaries, and logs out of messages.
